# Backlinking research UI

When editing files under `src/components/research/backlinking/`:

- **No helper / explanatory copy** under section titles (no muted subtitles like “Plain text for…”, “Same columns as…”, or “Pick a niche” prompts). Keep **labels only** where a heading is required.
- **Minimum font size 1rem** for all user-visible text: use Tailwind `text-base` (or `text-[1rem]` only if matching an existing pattern). Do **not** use `text-xs`, `text-sm`, or arbitrary sizes below `1rem` for body, labels, table cells, or buttons on this page.
- Icons may stay at `h-3 w-3` / `h-4 w-4`; focus the 1rem rule on **typography**.
